WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.087 --> 00:00:14.068
leaped into the air.

2
00:00:15.588 --> 00:00:19.049
His three companions and the horse fell into the water with a splash.

3
00:00:22.530 --> 00:00:24.591
Bajie climbed back out, coughing.

4
00:00:26.391 --> 00:00:29.452
Wujing came up next, pulling the horse behind him.

5
00:00:32.420 --> 00:00:33.760
"Where's the Tang Monk?"

6
00:00:34.041 --> 00:00:34.801
cried Wukong.

7
00:00:35.841 --> 00:00:40.362
Below the ice the Tang Monk struggled as the demon carried him deep underwater.

8
00:00:42.443 --> 00:00:43.223
demon laughed.

9
00:00:43.243 --> 00:00:46.884
"You all fell for my trick!

10
00:00:47.004 --> 00:00:50.105
I froze the river and waited for you to cross it.

11
00:00:51.506 --> 00:00:54.486
Once you were above me, I cracked the ice open.

12
00:00:55.507 --> 00:00:59.788
As soon as your friends leave, I will eat you and live forever!"

13
00:01:01.440 --> 00:01:02.940
They arrived at a palace.

14
00:01:03.501 --> 00:01:07.482
A sign over the door read "Residence of the River Turtle."

15
00:01:08.182 --> 00:01:11.543
The demon went inside and locked the monk in a stone box.

16
00:01:14.083 --> 00:01:17.224
Up on the ice, Wukong paced back and forth.

17
00:01:17.244 --> 00:01:21.465
"The ice didn't crack by accident," said the monkey.

18
00:01:21.485 --> 00:01:24.186
"I'm sure it was the demon.

19
00:01:25.386 --> 00:01:28.347
demon probably caused this strange cold weather too."

20
00:01:30.188 --> 00:01:31.860
He made a fist.

21
00:01:32.040 --> 00:01:33.761
can't believe we fell for his trick!

22
00:01:34.522 --> 00:01:36.263
We must save the Tang Monk!"

23
00:01:37.664 --> 00:01:40.605
Wukong stopped pacing and looked at his companions.

24
00:01:40.625 --> 00:01:43.747
"My powers aren't very strong underwater.

25
00:01:44.608 --> 00:01:47.610
You two must go down there and get the demon to come back up.

26
00:01:48.570 --> 00:01:49.491
I'll surprise him."

27
00:01:50.832 --> 00:01:53.994
Wujing and Bajie nodded and dived into the river.

28
00:01:55.655 --> 00:01:57.316
They soon spotted a palace.

29
00:02:01.652 --> 00:02:05.393
Wujing read the sign over the door: of the River Turtle.'

30
00:02:06.093 --> 00:02:07.594
I wonder if the demon is in here."

31
00:02:09.174 --> 00:02:09.974
knocked on the door.

32
00:02:09.994 --> 00:02:11.395
"Open up!"

33
00:02:11.695 --> 00:02:12.295
he shouted.

34
00:02:14.155 --> 00:02:15.996
door opened, and the demon stepped out.

35
00:02:18.156 --> 00:02:19.857
He was holding a large hammer.

36
00:02:21.097 --> 00:02:22.158
"What do you want?"

37
00:02:22.398 --> 00:02:22.938
he asked.

38
00:02:22.958 --> 00:02:25.518
"Did you kidnap our master?"

39
00:02:25.879 --> 00:02:26.579
asked Wujing.

40
00:02:28.219 --> 00:02:28.859
said the demon.

41
00:02:28.879 --> 00:02:31.060
"And I plan to eat him.

42
00:02:31.836 --> 00:02:32.956
Now go away!"

43
00:02:36.197 --> 00:02:40.118
The demon tried to close the door, but Wujing stopped the door with his spear.

44
00:02:41.599 --> 00:02:42.939
demon moved toward him.

45
00:02:44.079 --> 00:02:46.040
Bajie's rake came crashing down.

46
00:02:49.101 --> 00:02:50.881
The demon blocked the rake with his hammer.

47
00:02:51.761 --> 00:02:54.822
Fish and other creatures fled as the three spirits fought.

48
00:02:55.963 --> 00:02:59.023
After a few minutes, Bajie pretended to be scared.

49
00:02:59.684 --> 00:03:02.665
He swam upward, and Wujing soon followed.

50
00:03:02.685 --> 00:03:08.429
"Cowards!" called the demon, swimming after them toward the surface.

51
00:03:10.110 --> 00:03:12.572
The demon jumped out of the water and onto the ice.

52
00:03:17.435 --> 00:03:18.276
was waiting for him.

53
00:03:20.017 --> 00:03:21.698
The monkey swung his iron bar.

54
00:03:23.959 --> 00:03:24.720
demon ducked.

55
00:03:26.481 --> 00:03:27.402
The bar hit the ice.

56
00:03:29.363 --> 00:03:30.784
demon swung his hammer.

57
00:03:33.888 --> 00:03:35.389
More cracks formed in the ice.

58
00:03:37.190 --> 00:03:38.070
Boom! Crash!

59
00:03:38.671 --> 00:03:41.412
Weapons clashed as the spirits fought on the breaking ice.

60
00:03:42.393 --> 00:03:44.254
The demon hit Bajie's legs.

61
00:03:46.375 --> 00:03:47.075
cried the pig.

62
00:03:47.716 --> 00:03:50.437
He slid across the ice and slammed into Wujing.

63
00:03:50.537 --> 00:03:53.679
"Oof!" The purple spirit slipped and fell.

64
00:03:53.699 --> 00:03:57.461
"Ha!" The demon laughed and dived back under the ice.

65
00:03:58.421 --> 00:04:00.403
Bajie and Wujing stood back up.

66
00:04:00.423 --> 00:04:03.804
"The demon escaped," said the pig.

67
00:04:03.824 --> 00:04:07.847
"We must stop him before he eats the Tang Monk," said Wukong.

68
00:04:07.867 --> 00:04:10.848
"Go back down there and try to lead him up here again."

69
00:04:12.929 --> 00:04:15.191
Wujing and Bajie dived into the river.

70
00:04:17.352 --> 00:04:21.514
When they reached the palace, they found a huge pile of rocks blocking the door.

71
00:04:23.115 --> 00:04:24.455
struck the rocks with his rake.

72
00:04:25.676 --> 00:04:27.337
The rake bounced off the rock pile.

73
00:04:28.438 --> 00:04:29.678
rocks didn't move at all.

74
00:04:30.439 --> 00:04:33.636
Wujing stabbed at the rocks with his spear.

75
00:04:33.816 --> 00:04:35.237
Again, the rocks didn't move.

76
00:04:35.257 --> 00:04:38.359
"What kind of rocks are these?"

77
00:04:38.719 --> 00:04:39.400
cried the pig.

78
00:04:39.420 --> 00:04:43.842
"Maybe they're held in place with magic," said Wujing.

79
00:04:44.823 --> 00:04:48.185
They returned to the surface of the river and told Wukong about the rocks.

80
00:04:50.146 --> 00:04:51.007
monkey sighed.

81
00:04:51.027 --> 00:04:52.187
"We need
